    <title>Plain City: data center moratorium — Proposed</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/plain-city-oh</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-plain-city-oh</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Council shelved its draft zoning rules — the village attorney warned the Big Darby Creek setback might not survive a challenge — and scheduled an Aug 10 vote on a 6-month moratorium. No outlet has reported the outcome; do not cite this as enacted</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Avon Lake: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/avon-lake-oh</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-avon-lake-oh</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Ordinance 26-60, an emergency measure effective on the mayor&#x27;s approval Jun 23 and running through Jun 22, 2027, extendable once by up to six months. Bars consideration, approval or authorization of any data center as a permitted, conditional or accessory use, including zoning permits, building permits and certificates of occupancy, and tolls the clock on pending applications so nothing is approved by default. Excludes a data center incidental to a permitted principal use. Section 4 bars any data-center zoning framework reaching council until the city completes fiscal, infrastructure and community-impact analyses and at least two publicly noticed hearings</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Grafton: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/grafton-oh</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-grafton-oh</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Five-year halt on data center development — the longest local term in this tracker — adopted at a regular council meeting after community polling and on the mayor&#x27;s recommendation, following discussion of how long the restriction should run</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Hubbard: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/hubbard-oh</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-hubbard-oh</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
